SFWD,	0	/SEARCH FORWARD LIST, LABEL NO. IN AC
	CIA; DCA T2; TAD (-200; DCA T3
	TAD (2777; DCA T1
SFWD1,	ISZ T1; TAD I T1; TAD T2
